  "description": "The S3 is a full-on Shift model that shares the same main design and hydroformed tubing as its higher-end siblings. Our first model in the Shift line features our new single pivot suspension design with low forward pivot point, 120mm of front & rear travel with lightweight Suntour suspension, 2x10 Deore drivetrain, Suntour XCM 2-pc crankset and Tektro hydraulic disc brakes.\n6061-T6 Series alloy Dual Suspended Single Pivot frame, 120mm rear travel, Tapered 1.5\" head tube, 73mm BB shell, 9mm Q/R rear dropouts\nSuntour Raidon-R rear shock w/ adjustable rebound\nSuntour Raidon-XC-LO-R-27.5 1-1/8-1.5\" Taper alloy steerer, 120mm travel, Air Spring w/ Hydraulic Lockout\nSuntour XCM 38/24T crankset w/ 24mm Axle, 10-speed compatible\nSuntour 73mm sealed cartridge BB\nShimano Deore front & rear derailleurs & shifters\nShimano Deore 10-speed 11-34T cassette\nWTB Pure Sport saddle\nPivit alloy cockpit with 0 Deg. Trail stem",
